---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');
---

<Layout title="SSRDOG 深度评测 - GlobalNet Labs">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href={`${base}/vpn`} onclick="history.back();return false;" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-6">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        返回 VPN 列表
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-10">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
          <img src={`${base}/images/ssrdog.webp`} alt="SSRDOG" class="h-8 w-auto" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-1">SSRDOG 深度评测</h1>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg">高速 IEPL/IPLC 专线机场，66+ 节点覆盖 17 国</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">评分概览</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-400">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">综合评分</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">8.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">速度性能</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">节点覆盖</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.5</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">流媒体解锁</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.5</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">性价比</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">产品概述</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          SSRDOG 是一家成立于 2022 年的网络加速服务商，总部位于新加坡。全线采用 Shadowsocks 协议和 IEPL/IPLC 内网专线，拥有 66+ 节点覆盖 17 个国家和地区。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          核心优势是 IEPL/IPLC 专线不过 GFW，敏感时期抗干扰能力强。轻量套餐均速约 40MB/s，峰值 75MB/s。港台节点延迟低至 25-50ms。支持 Netflix、Disney+、HBO Max、TikTok、ChatGPT 等主流平台解锁。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          轻量套餐 ¥25/月 150GB，企业套餐 ¥50/月 200GB 流量永久有效。提供 24 小时 3GB 免费试用。定制客户端支持 Windows/macOS/Android，iOS 推荐 Shadowrocket。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">核心特性详解</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">IEPL/IPLC 内网专线</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">全线接入 IEPL/IPLC 国际专线，不经过 GFW。敏感时期不受干扰，晚高峰表现稳定。不复用线路，带宽冗余保障。峰值 1000Mbps 宽带。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">66+ 节点 17 国覆盖</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">香港 15 节点（延迟 11ms）、台湾 10、日本 10、新加坡 10、美国 10、韩国 2。覆盖港、日、韩、新、美、英、加、土、印、荷、法、德、越等。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">流媒体 + AI 解锁</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Netflix、Disney+、YouTube、HBO Max、TikTok 全线解锁。ChatGPT/OpenAI 几乎全线节点支持。Spotify 仅支持已有账号登录。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">游戏友好 FullCone</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">绝大多数节点支持 FullCone NAT，对联机游戏（Switch/PS5/Xbox）及 P2P 场景兼容性好。低延迟适合实时对战。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">24 小时免费试用</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">注册即送 24 小时 3GB 试用流量，充分体验节点质量。轻量套餐 ¥25/月 150GB，年付低至 ¥17/月。企业套餐 ¥50/月 200GB 流量永久有效。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">全平台支持</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">定制客户端支持 Windows、macOS、Android。iOS 推荐 Shadowrocket/Quantumult X/Surge。一键订阅导入，新手友好。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">适用场景详细分析</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">1. 跨境网络加速</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">IEPL/IPLC 专线保障低延迟和高稳定，适合远程办公、跨境团队协作和国际业务访问。敏感时期抗干扰能力强。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">2. 流媒体解锁</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">原生解锁 Netflix、Disney+、HBO Max、TikTok 等主流平台。港台节点 25-50ms 低延迟，4K 流畅播放。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">3. AI 工具访问</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">全线节点针对 ChatGPT/OpenAI 优化，几乎完整解锁。适合需要稳定访问 AI 工具的深度用户。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">4. 在线游戏</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">FullCone NAT 支持，港台节点 25-50ms 低延迟，适合联机游戏加速和 Steam 跨区商店访问。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">优势与局限</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>优势
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>IEPL/IPLC 专线不过墙</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>港台节点 25-50ms 低延迟</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>Netflix/ChatGPT 全线解锁</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>轻量套餐 ¥25/月 150GB</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>24 小时免费试用</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>FullCone NAT 游戏友好</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>注意事项
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>非传统 VPN，需第三方客户端</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>Spotify 禁止新注册</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>曾遭受网络攻击影响稳定性</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>无独立审计信息</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">总结评价</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          SSRDOG 以 IEPL/IPLC 内网专线为核心卖点，在网络加速服务市场中建立了"稳定、高速、抗干扰"的品牌形象。66+ 节点和 17 国覆盖在同价位中配置出色。</p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Netflix、Disney+、ChatGPT 的全线解锁和 FullCone NAT 游戏支持使其成为综合型选择。¥25/月 150GB 的定价性价比突出，24 小时免费试用降低了试错成本。</p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          综合评估，SSRDOG 获得 7.0 分，特别推荐给需要稳定专线和流媒体解锁的跨境办公用户和重度流媒体爱好者。</p>
      </section>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="https://dog.ssrdog.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-lg">
          访问 SSRDOG 官网
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>